        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Dull intermittent deep left ear ache for 4–5 days, worse when lying on that side, especially at night; mild itch. Paracetamol taken a couple of nights ago gave partial relief. Patient has applied olive oil with a cotton bud and says it might have helped a little."
      }
    },
    {
