        "code": {
          "text": "Left ear examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "External ear normal. Mild erythema of outer canal with minimal dry scaling; no debris or significant swelling; no tragal or pinna tenderness. Tympanic membrane intact with normal light reflex; no effusion, perforation, or haemotympanum. No mastoid tenderness or swelling."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
